WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.721
"That frog was huge!"

2
00:00:03.761 --> 00:00:04.541
said Terrell.

3
00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:07.143
"Where did it come from?"

4
00:00:07.984 --> 00:00:08.284
asked Mara.

5
00:00:08.304 --> 00:00:08.985
"I don't know," said Jack.

6
00:00:09.005 --> 00:00:32.633
Roxy didn't say She had to turn into Rocket Girl and go downtown.

7
00:00:33.513 --> 00:00:35.053
But she couldn't let her friends see her.

8
00:00:36.054 --> 00:00:37.234
Roxy thought for a moment.

9
00:00:38.254 --> 00:00:39.395
Then she had an idea.

10
00:00:43.796 --> 00:00:46.357
Roxy screamed as she pretended to spot another frog.

11
00:00:46.377 --> 00:00:48.597
"A giant frog!

12
00:00:48.857 --> 00:00:50.158
Run for your lives."

13
00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:54.479
Then she disappeared into the woods.

14
00:00:54.499 --> 00:00:58.440
"Hmm," thought Terrell, looking around.

15
00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:00.240
"That's odd.

16
00:01:00.881 --> 00:01:02.902
I don't see any other giant frogs."

17
00:01:07.504 --> 00:01:11.346
When Roxy landed downtown, she saw giant, slimy frogs everywhere.

18
00:01:14.748 --> 00:01:16.289
Three of them hopped down West Street.

19
00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.871
They left a trail of wet footprints.

20
00:01:20.832 --> 00:01:24.453
Other frogs clung to the sides of buildings, making horrible croaking sounds.

21
00:01:25.614 --> 00:01:26.535
Roxy felt sick.

22
00:01:27.275 --> 00:01:28.896
"Ugh." She groaned.

23
00:01:29.948 --> 00:01:32.809
"Why couldn't the city be invaded by giant squirrels?

24
00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.130
Squirrels are cute."

25
00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:37.231
"Rocket Girl!"

26
00:01:37.571 --> 00:01:38.652
shouted Detective Smith.

27
00:01:42.453 --> 00:01:43.194
glad you're here!"

28
00:01:43.214 --> 00:01:47.175
"Uh, hi, Detective," she mumbled.

29
00:01:48.476 --> 00:01:50.076
Detective Smith looked surprised.

30
00:01:50.096 --> 00:01:52.117
"Are you okay?

31
00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:53.998
Aren't you going to make a joke?"

32
00:01:55.059 --> 00:01:56.659
A frog landed on a nearby car.

33
00:01:59.768 --> 00:02:03.511
Skrunch! "I'm not really in a joking mood," said Roxy weakly.

34
00:02:06.013 --> 00:02:07.855
Another frog knocked over a streetlamp.

35
00:02:09.376 --> 00:02:10.777
Ribbit! Ribbit!

36
00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:14.781
"This is terrible," said Detective Smith.

37
00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:20.385
"We need to find out how these frogs got so—" "Rocket Girl!

38
00:02:20.525 --> 00:02:21.386
Save me!"

39
00:02:21.726 --> 00:02:22.547
a voice screamed.

40
00:02:23.728 --> 00:02:24.509
Roxy looked up.

41
00:02:25.469 --> 00:02:28.092
Halfway up a building was a frog with a car in its mouth.

42
00:02:28.992 --> 00:02:30.413
The driver was still inside.

43
00:02:30.433 --> 00:02:32.075
"Oh no!"

44
00:02:32.495 --> 00:02:33.236
cried Roxy.

45
00:02:34.136 --> 00:02:36.138
It didn't matter that Roxy was scared of frogs.

46
00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.802
She was Rocket Girl, and Metro City needed her help!

47
00:02:42.223 --> 00:02:43.684
She flew as fast as she could.

48
00:02:44.705 --> 00:02:47.067
Ribbit! A frog leaped in front of Roxy.

49
00:02:47.908 --> 00:02:48.789
She swooped over it.

50
00:02:48.809 --> 00:02:52.332
"These frogs are everywhere!"

51
00:02:52.692 --> 00:02:53.332
said Roxy.

52
00:02:54.433 --> 00:02:55.995
Down on the street, someone screamed.

53
00:02:56.015 --> 00:02:57.316
"Look out!"

54
00:02:58.288 --> 00:03:00.849
A fat frog had knocked over the big bear statue.

55
00:03:01.709 --> 00:03:03.990
The statue was about to fall on a group of people.

56
00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.270
Roxy flew down and caught it.

57
00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:14.792
She placed the statue back on its Roxy shot toward the frog with the car.

58
00:03:15.613 --> 00:03:18.413
When the frog saw Roxy, it flicked its tongue at her.

59
00:03:19.154 --> 00:03:23.355
Thwap! The car fell out of the frog's mouth.

60
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:25.935
"Whoa!" cried Roxy.

61
00:03:26.836 --> 00:03:27.896
Roxy dived fast.

62
00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:32.572
Zoom! She caught the car just before it hit the street.

63
00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:35.634
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!"

64
00:03:35.975 --> 00:03:36.635
said the driver.

65
00:03:36.655 --> 00:03:39.317
"No problem," said Roxy.

66
00:03:39.337 --> 00:03:41.659
"I'm glad I could—" Thwap!

67
00:03:41.679 --> 00:03:45.403
"Agh!" Roxy screamed.
